  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Akirachix - training women in ICT - Audit Ernest &amp; Young</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Akirachix - utbilda kvinnor i ICT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ICT omr&#xe5;det &#xe4;r det snabbaste v&#xe4;xande omr&#xe5;det i Kenya (+24% av GDP     tillv&#xe4;xten) och den st&#xf6;rsta m&#xf6;jligheten f&#xf6;r unga att f&#xe5; fast jobb.    Arbetsl&#xf6;sheten bland unga &#xe4;r h&#xf6;g. det finns en oproportionell l&#xe5;g     andel kvinnor inom omr&#xe5;det och &#xe4;nnu f&#xe4;rre fattiga kvinnor. Insatsen   syftar till att utj&#xe4;mna oj&#xe4;mlikheterna och engagera fler fattiga      kvinnor inom ICT.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ICT business is the fastest growing area in Kenya (+24% of GDP    growth) and biggest oppourtunity for young people to get job. The     unemployment among you people are high. There is disproportional low  number women in this area and there is even less poor women in the    ICT area. The contribution aim to level the inequality and engage     more poor women in ICT.</narrative>
  </description>
